      ],
      "source": "https://kimandcarrie.com/robbinsville-north-carolina/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Robbinsville’s post office, which opened in 1843, originally served Cheoah Valley before moving to Fort Montgomery in 1849.",
